WEBVTT

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.240
Cosmo-san...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.990
It's unusual to see you here... are you working?

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:15.990
That's right.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.960
When I shut myself in my room, my ideas came to a cosmic stop.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.000
I thought I'd try going to a café...

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.330
You seem out of sorts.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.170
You're looking pale and wan.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.060
You sleeping properly?

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.670
Once you clear twenty, lack of sleep does a number on your skin.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:38.010
Let's see here. Let ol' Dorothy and her keen fashion sense give you some feedback.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.100
Mm, yeah, it's kind of blah.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.930
You thought so too? It <i>is</i> kind of blah.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.400
No, that's not it. If anything, it should be simpler.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.360
"Simple"... I suppose that could work.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.590
You crazy? It should be more flashy.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:53.860
"Simple is best".

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:54.560
Flashy!

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:55.320
Simple!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:55.800
Flashy!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.360
Simple!

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:56.740
Flashy!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.200
Simple!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:57.490
Flashy!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:57.870
Simple!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.120
Flashy!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:58.490
Simple!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:58.780
Flashy!

00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.160
Simple!

00:00:59.160 --> 00:00:59.410
Flashy!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:00:59.770
Simple!

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:00.030
Flashy!

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:00.350
Simple!

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:00.620
Flappy!

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:00.860
You tire!

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:00.920
Onee-sama...

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:01.150
Flashy!

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:01.550
Simple!

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:01.790
Flashy!

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:01.810
Onee-sama...

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.780
Cosmo-san?

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:07.250
Cosmo-san seems to be struggling with her designs.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.710
Is she in Worn-Out Mode?

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.610
Designers do have it tough-usa...

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:15.810
Compared to all the new idols we keep getting, there's a real lack of designers-kuma...

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.360
Da Vinci!

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.220
Kuma?

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.760
Cosmo! Big news-Da Vinci!

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:21.770
Vincent van Get this! You won't Dal-ieve it!

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.730
Ajimi-sensei, Meganii-san.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.350
I have good news, Miss Cosmo. It's finally complete!

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.370
You're cosmically serious?

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:31.820
What's this about-pri?

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:34.600
Indeed! Look and be amazed:

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.070
fix your attention on this big stylish machine!

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:23.970
What's this? I''m so intrigued!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:27.420
With this Dress Design machine, everyone's a designer!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.850
You can produce-tave Courbet a dress in moments!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.440
It's the key-th Haring to a new era-Da Vinci!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:35.810
Wow, it sounds amazing!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:43.960
It's going to be installed in PriPara's newest attraction, the My Dress Design Room.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.870
All of you, make sure you come visit.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.330
Dress Design
You bet we'll go!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:52.580
If we get lots of designs from you guys,
it'll cosmically help me out!
Dress Design

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.860
That's two birds with one stone!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.300
After all, we can amuse ourselves designing!

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:00.170
I think you'll find it's <i>three</i> birds with one stone.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:04.760
You see, we'll accept the fruits of your labour as submissions for PriPara Collection –

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:08.470
that's ParaColle for short –
a dress designing event we've been planning!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.390
And ParaColle's theme:

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.400
Awaken! The Goddess's Dress Design!

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:21.360
You'll model the dresses you designed yourselves on ParaColle's runway –

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.320
you'll all have a blast, I'm sure.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.970
And Ajimi and I will cosmically evaluate all the dresses,

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.790
and elect one Fashion Leader!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.710
"Fashion Leader"? Man, that title was <i>made</i> for me!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.810
Right, Reona?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:38.500
Yep, it sure was!

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.320
Incomprehensible.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.090
I can't comprehend Dorothy's taste in the least.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.690
Say that again? That's just cause you're so frumpy and boring!

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.220
Grr...

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.680
Hey, come on, you two...

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:56.150
My Dress Design Room is scheduled to open today at noon.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:59.360
We'll be awaiting you with open heart and arms.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:04.320
Hello, everyone! As per those
advertisements which popped up,

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:08.990
My Dress Design Room has been opened here in PriPara!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:13.120
We encourage you all to come up with your own original designs and take part in ParaColle!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.090
Last time we summoned the brand LoveDevi!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.340
We shall reign over ParaColle as well!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.380
The stage shall be ours alone!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:25.550
Yeppers!
The stage shall be ours alone!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.760
Devi-devi-devi!
Yeppers!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.800
Devi-devi-devi!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.300
Does something ail you, Garuru?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.680
There's clothes I've wanted to wear for a long time-garu.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.480
Oho...

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:38.620
Well, then, those with numbered tickets 1 to 30 may enter.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.010
Please proceed in an orderly fashion.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.580
Let's jump right in-pri!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.530
Ooh, it's so exciting!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.370
I'm looking forward to it...

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.040
So... what exactly should I do-pri?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.560
It's a cosmic cinch to work.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:04.260
First you choose a pattern outline from a galaxy of options.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.380
For example...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.470
How about this one?

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.980
After the pattern outline, it's colour.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.170
Start with your main colour,

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.900
then ribbons,

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.230
wings

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.300
and button – all those colours, too.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:27.400
Then you can switch up the pattern and their colours, too.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:32.870
That's so cool! The feeling changes completely when you use and remove the checkered pattern!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.200
Designing so freely looks like a lot of fun!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.370
And that's it down to a cosmos!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.670
You don't have to draw anything –
you sim-pri pick and choose!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.650
Let's get to designing a dress for SoLaMi SMILE straight away!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.630
Something that suits all three of us!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.130
But-pri...

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.890
I'm pop.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.640
Sophie's cool.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.740
And Lala's lovely!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.100
I don't know whom we should use as a base-pri.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.370
You can design without getting stuck on a "type".

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.060
That's part of the fun with this Dress Design!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.030
I like this!

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.110
It's cute!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.740
What about the colour-pri?

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:15.450
We always wear different colours,
so how about we have the same one each this time?

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.990
That sounds pri good!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.710
And the design's slightly different for each of us-pri?

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.180
What colour is best?

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:26.970
Hey, how about light blue? There's the "looking up at the sky" feeling in SoLaMi, so sky-coloured!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.050
Sure! I like it!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.100
And the pattern...

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.470
Hey! I like this!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.430
Yeah, this is good!

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.430
And we're the first ones to pri-nt it!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:43.200
Yeah, this is great!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:47.820
Now we just need to design some remixes, and it's com-pri-te!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.780
Capisce!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:56.740
Of course, claiming the first numbered ticket,
cool and collected, was me!

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.210
<i>You understand, then, your destiny as a team:</i>

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.370
<i>to become Divine Idols!</i>

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.970
<i>And you must act as a team, as NonSugar!</i>

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:07.670
Janice was pretty insistent,

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:12.190
so I decided we should design a coord for NonSugar to wear...

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.490
Make something strong!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.880
With claws, all "shing"!

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:20.020
Fur, all "floof"! Cool outfit!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.650
A dress for NonSugar to wear?

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:24.150
Surely you're joking.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:27.360
I will design my coord entirely by myself.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:32.240
Man, Pepper and Chiri are just the worst at being friendly!

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:39.080
I guess I'll just have to design some dresses
for Triangle instead! That'll be heaps more fun!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.350
Here it is! It came out so well!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.330
All right, here we come!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.350
Hey, let me see!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.540
Fired up and ready for action!

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.000
Man, there's heaps of stuff!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.820
I like polka dots, stripes and checked patterns,

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.500
so let's chuck 'em all in!

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.720
Um, well, it's not <i>bad</i>, but...

00:08:55.110 --> 00:09:00.010
When you have multiple patterns like that, adding different colours and materials

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.090
requires a tera cosmically deft hand.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.350
Allow me to try.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.860
Your taste is simply bizarre.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.150
"Simple is the best".

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:10.560
The main colour is black.
This part and this part are also black.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.110
And white to complement.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:14.570
Yes, this is perfect!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.730
Man, this pattern is super played out.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:17.920
It looks like a penguin.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:18.300
Like a panda!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.300
Dorothy...

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.950
Like a Holstein cow. A zebra.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.700
A tapir. A police car.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.910
A rice ball!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.890
You're simply ignorant of modern style!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.880
Come on, you two...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.940
Fashion should be fun...

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.060
Reona's exactly right-Da Vinci!

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.140
Ajimi-sensei?

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.330
Can we have fun with design? Yes, we canvas!

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.390
And we're done before you can say "Leonardo Da Vinci"!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.300
Outrageous!

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:48.700
One couldn't even control one's movements in such garb!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:52.020
My word, what discord you lot are in!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.850
Ka-boom!

00:09:55.850 --> 00:10:00.160
Yes! Pl-easel insult me more-Da Vinci!

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.410
For crying out loud.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.730
Thanks to Ajimi-sensei messing around, I've totally lost my train of thought.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.920
My head's a mess. I'm calling it quits for today.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.530
You want to finish for today?

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.450
Can't we stay for a bit longer?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.340
Mind and body wearied.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.800
Listening to Dorothy's endless criticisms is exhausting.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:26.570
But SoLaMi SMILE and everyone else have finished their designs.

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:29.520
We should decide on a theme, too...

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:33.520
Can't we just pick something each of us likes and go with that?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.570
I'm of the same mind.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.990
It have no intention of aligning my sense with Dorothy's.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:40.320
Okay...

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.160
I'm home!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.720
Welcome back.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:46.870
Hi, Sophie-san.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.800
Reona-chan! Did you come to play?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.790
Yep.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.840
I was getting some advice about
the Dress Design system from Cosmo-san.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:58.010
A coord for Dressing Pafé?

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:58.550
Yep.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:03.890
Shion and Dorothy have designs for their own styles...

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:09.550
But I want to make something that works for all of us and gives us a sense of harmony

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:12.450
and enter ParaColle together like that.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.270
But I...

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.580
I don't really know how to do that.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.460
I see...

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.610
My goodness, just look at the time.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.600
I think it's time for tea, don't you?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.910
You stay and eat too, Reona-chan. We're having tenzaru soba!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:32.810
We've got refreshing chewy soba
and a whole heap of yummy tempura sides.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.670
Make sure you try it with the special dashi-based sauce as well.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.090
Let's eat!

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:42.050
Tenzaru soba is number one in all the cosmos!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:45.250
I love tenzaru soba too!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.930
<i>Refreshing chewy soba...</i>

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.250
<i>Shion!</i>

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:56.220
<i>And the overwhelming, powerful and diverse tempura dishes...</i>

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:57.730
<i>Dorothy!</i>

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.690
<i>Then does that make me...</i>

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:05.200
<i>the sauce which improves the taste of both of them?</i>

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:12.120
Thank you, Cosmo-san!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.080
Oh – um...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:19.040
You can't have tenzaru soba with just soba or tempura...

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:22.050
You need the tasty sauce as well, right?

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.510
S–Sure...

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:49.420
And with that, we've com-pri-ted all three designs!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.210
Yep!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.130
Capisce!

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:53.040
ParaColle, bring it on!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:13:00.210
Our new LoveDevi coords have been spawned successfully!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.080
Yep!

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.220
What coord did Garuru want to bring forth...?

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:12.680
I shall design this coord with the same diligence I exercise in flower arrangement.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.520
And thus, it is complete – perfect!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.050
Woo! My dress finished too!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:23.190
See, Chiri! Want to see? Want to see?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.620
Why would you pull a PriTickets from such a place?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.370
You beast! Quit my sight now!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.660
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!
You two are fighting <i>again</i>?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.290
ParaColle's starting any minute now!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.190
The time has come for us as well.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.750
I'm gonna stand out more than anyone else!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.210
Hold on a moment.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.590
Reona?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:49.680
You see... I designed a really Dressing Pafé-esque coord.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.630
I wanted to use the same pattern and give us a sense of harmony.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:56.640
And I thought about our individual points, too.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:57.900
Here!

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:07.940
Shion's has a plaid pattern, expressing her straightforward personality.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:10.570
And we can be a bit adventurous with some colour.

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.120
So that's...

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:12.780
Yep!

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.740
Er...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.120
What is it, Shion?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.330
O–Oh, er... no, it's nothing.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:23.410
Dorothy's coord has colours with a really strong contrast!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.140
My colours are different, too.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.760
Isn't it a great fit?

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.970
Hey, yeah! I like it!

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:33.640
Come on, Reona, you shoulda told us you had such a good eye for design!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.430
Well, there's certainly a sense of team unity...

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:42.700
I want to become your soba sauce and harmonise you well!

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.150
Soba sauce?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.110
I knew you could do it, Reona-chan.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:50.130
You could design this because
you knew their individualities so well.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.070
Was it a cosmic struggle?

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:59.290
It was a lot of fun designing something with both of them in mind!

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:01.250
This holds Reona's feelings.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.550
Thank you, Reona!

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:07.210
Now, let's <i>go</i> to ParaColle!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.520
Thank you for waiting!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:16.410
Now, let the first ParaColle event,
"Awaken! The Goddess's Dress Design", commence!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.460
Our commentators: Ajimi "Art Is a Bang"-sensei

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.250
Ka-boom!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.350
Our commentators: Ajimi "Art Is a Bang"-sensei

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:22.570
And Cyalume Coord Maestro, Miss Cosmo!

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.900
Cosmic yay!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:25.760
And Cyalume Coord Maestro, Miss Cosmo!

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.860
Let's showtime!

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:33.070
Lala, Sophie and Mirei – it's SoLaMi SMILE-Da Vinci!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.820
"Look up at the sky and smile"!

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:41.250
Taking inspiration from SoLaMi SMILE's motto,
it's a sky-blue dress!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.350
A light, fresh colour – and it makes the heart light and fresh, too!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.130
It's Aromageddon-Da Vinci!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.300
From the hottest brand fusing devil and angel:

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.720
LoveDevi's newest coord!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:59.350
It's a combination bringing together sweetness and poison!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.810
Next up is Chiri-echtenstein!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:03.240
Good day to you all!

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:08.770
Flowers abound in the hair and chest accessories –
a true flower arrangement dress!

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:12.280
And in addition to its beauty,
it expresses soothing floral fragrances!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:15.240
Next up: Pepper Lion!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:19.860
Here we have a gallant dress, taking
"lion, king of a hundred beasts" as its motif!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:23.710
And a leopard's tail brought into the mix expresses more power!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:29.140
And here's Triangle's Junon – it's a <i>non, non</i> Non gallery!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:29.940
Ju.

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.850
And Pinon-Da Vinci!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:34.080
Pippi-pappi-pu!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:37.360
And last up is Kanon-Da Vinci!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.970
Kano-pero!

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:42.910
And that's the genuine article – no Hologrammation here, folks!

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.940
That's a cosmically fast outfit change!

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:48.900
Garu! It's Garuru-garu-garu-gargantua!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:52.610
She's so cute!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.070
Well wrought.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.030
Garu!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:00.210
And – my word-Da Vinci!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:05.500
Coming in from PriParis for a guest appearance, it's Falulu-Da Vinci!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.500
Pri!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.400
What a great surprise!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.490
You look lovely, Falulu!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.730
Garuru is wearing the Paprika Academy primary school section's uniform,

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:17.370
and Falulu's in the junior high section's uniform!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.140
Now these are some coords you'd normally never see!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.320
It really warms  your heart, doesn't it?

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.100
You look great!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.790
Oh? And who's up Mon-ext?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.930
It's another surprise guest, Fuwari-Da Vinci!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.570
Does this mean...

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.490
I knew it! It's Little Curly!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:43.140
Fuwari and Hibiki have both rushed here from PriParis as well,

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:46.040
to show off their My Design coords!

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.160
Last but not least...

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:53.760
From Dressing Pafé – Shion, Dorothy and Reona-Da Vinci!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.080
And all three coords were designed by Reona!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:00.220
Shion's is an uncharacteristically cute, country-style design!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:05.000
Dorothy and Reona are popping –
wearing matching stardust-patterned coords!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.190
They may look dissimilar at a glance,

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.400
but together they're three as one – a wonderful coord!

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:24.240
The Fashion Leader for the first ParaColle event, "Awaken! The Goddess's Dress Design" is...

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.870
Our contestants from Dressing Pafé!

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.600
Cosmic congratulations!

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.170
We did it!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.490
Hey, Reona-chan – your designs <i>cosmically</i> caught my eye.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.560
How about marrying into our family?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.190
Wha–?

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.080
I'm kidding. Just a galactic gag, you know!

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:44.600
What's that? What's a gag, now?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.480
And incidentally,

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:52.040
due to its smashing success, the My Dress Design Room system will be permanently installed in PriPara.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.570
Feel free to use it from now on, as well!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.530
Okay!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:20.030
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:23.030
Gajira!

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:23.990
Transform:

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:26.030
PriPara Go Change!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.030
Idol Soldiers:

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.040
PriPara Girls!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.420
Lock on!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.880
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.310
<i>Go</i>!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.020
Yay!

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:25.220
It's here!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:28.800
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:32.260
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.640
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.900
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.020
Hup!

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.060
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.400
<i>Go!</i>

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:03.550
The closet's doors open for you...

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.260
Within is an item fit for a Divine Idol!

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:15.560
All right! One rare item for us!

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:18.470
That's the way it's gotta be!

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:53.600
Today's Onee-chan's birthday!

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:54.240
Capisce!

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:58.210
There's something I really want to do for my birthday!

00:23:58.210 --> 00:23:59.960
A birthday performance with Non!

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:01.930
What? No way!

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:04.510
Onee-chan, you and I are <i>rivals</i>, you know?

00:24:04.510 --> 00:24:07.250
And besides, I've got heaps to worry about with NonSugar...

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:10.570
Come on, let's do a song together! You'll do it, right?

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:12.380
I <i>said</i> no! No way, no how!

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.740
Come on – you'll do it, right?

00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:17.150
Next time, <i>A Sisterly Capisce!</i>

00:24:17.150 --> 00:24:19.980
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
